Implemented a category scraper using Playwright and Selenium to handle the ALDI homepage.

Practiced using Headless Mode in Playwright to run the browser in the background and Webdriver Manager in Selenium for easy setup.

Implemented a category scraper using curl_cffi and cloudscraper

Configured all four scrapers to connect to a local MongoDB database, using unique indexes on the URL to prevent saving the same category twice.

Refined the filtering logic to specifically capture "Unique Category URLs" by excluding individual product pages and keeping only the /products/ paths.


